    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6dfc3cc3_6bdf2faf",
        "filename": "tradefed/autogen.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 167,
      "author": {
        "id": 1535516
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-05T18:48:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added OptionsForAutogenerated to add `\u003coption\u003e` tags like you\u0027re doing for the test runner. But I believe [the options I\u0027m using it for](https://cs.android.com/search?q\u003dtradefed_options%20f:%5C.bp\u0026sq\u003d\u0026ss\u003dandroid) could just be put under the `\u003ctest\u003e` tag as well, having them outside just happened to also apply to the `\u003ctest\u003e`.\n\nCould we deduplicate `OptionsForAutogenerated` and `TestRunnerOptions`?",
      "revId": "ec7314336a2b35ea30ce5438b83949c28e3ac429",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "aa240980_1cc9a789",
        "filename": "tradefed/autogen.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 167,
      "author": {
        "id": 1088076
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-05T21:17:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you point me to some example? I don\u0027t see `OptionsForAutogenerated` has a way to indicate it\u0027s under or above `\u003ctest\u003e` tag.",
      "parentUuid": "6dfc3cc3_6bdf2faf",
      "revId": "ec7314336a2b35ea30ce5438b83949c28e3ac429",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a50b237b_b6685e00",
        "filename": "tradefed/autogen.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 167,
      "author": {
        "id": 1535516
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-05T21:20:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It doesn\u0027t have a way to indicate if it\u0027s in the `\u003ctest\u003e` tag or not. I\u0027m saying that we can just move it to be inside the `\u003ctest\u003e` tag, so it\u0027s the same as `TestRunnerOptions`. Then dedup it.",
      "parentUuid": "aa240980_1cc9a789",
      "revId": "ec7314336a2b35ea30ce5438b83949c28e3ac429",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5b1bd07b_da43d29b",
        "filename": "tradefed/autogen.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 167,
      "author": {
        "id": 1088076
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-05T21:21:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But some options are meant to be on the top level, e.g., global configs. Having them inside test element can be wrong.",
      "parentUuid": "a50b237b_b6685e00",
      "revId": "ec7314336a2b35ea30ce5438b83949c28e3ac429",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "25273d55_7c2e8484",
        "filename": "tradefed/autogen.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 167,
      "author": {
        "id": 1535516
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-05T21:23:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The only usages of `OptionsForAutogenerated` we have in android today can go either inside or outside of the `\u003ctest\u003e` tag.",
      "parentUuid": "5b1bd07b_da43d29b",
      "revId": "ec7314336a2b35ea30ce5438b83949c28e3ac429",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "bad55923_0323716f",
        "filename": "tradefed/autogen.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 167,
      "author": {
        "id": 1088076
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-05T21:31:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do feel that having this option to add more global options can be handy. And the current naming `tradefed_options` is generic for global options. How about let\u0027s keep both for now?",
      "parentUuid": "25273d55_7c2e8484",
      "revId": "ec7314336a2b35ea30ce5438b83949c28e3ac429",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5cbb9646_000339b6",
        "filename": "tradefed/autogen.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 167,
      "author": {
        "id": 1535516
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-05T21:38:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it\u0027s actually correct to have global `\u003coptions\u003e` tags. I can\u0027t find a definitive source on this, but [this page](https://source.android.com/docs/core/tests/tradefed/architecture/xml-config) seems to imply you shouldn\u0027t put `\u003coption\u003e` tags directly in the `\u003cconfiguration\u003e` tag. \n\nI don\u0027t think we should have 2 methods to do the same thing because it\u0027s more confusing for users.\n\nAt the very least, the difference should be documented.",
      "parentUuid": "bad55923_0323716f",
      "revId": "ec7314336a2b35ea30ce5438b83949c28e3ac429",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e3193a0c_4e5454ef",
        "filename": "tradefed/autogen.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 167,
      "author": {
        "id": 1088076
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-05T21:44:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I don\u0027t think it\u0027s actually correct to have global \u003coptions\u003e tags. \n\ntradefed option is actually quite flexible, it has logic to look up all possible objects to inject options, or based on OptionClass alias setting, e.g.,\n\u003coption name\u003d\"config-descriptor:metadata\" key\u003d\"parameter\" value\u003d\"not_instant_app\"/\u003e\n\n\u003e At the very least, the difference should be documented.\nsure, what\u0027s the best place? I don\u0027t recall we have non-autogenerated javadoc for Android.bp",
      "parentUuid": "5cbb9646_000339b6",
      "revId": "ec7314336a2b35ea30ce5438b83949c28e3ac429",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
